+Because the foreign process is alive on the machine, `_process_liveness` returns `"alive"`. Therefore:
+- `self.physical_liveness()` returns `"alive"`.
+- `self.physically_alive()` returns `True` (line 1487: `return self.physical_liveness() != "dead"`).
+- `_abandon_unstarted()` (lines 1694-1700) aborts immediately:
